# Hinterlands (Horde) - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every rank-flagged rare spawning in the Hinterlands (10, zone key
# 1425) and every fixed treasure object (3), verified against the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever NPC/object/item dumps) for a Horde
# player. Single-point rares get plain steps; Old Cliff Jumper rides a
# 2-point loop (one Hinterlands point, one Hillsbrad point). Every goal
# is optional - a missing spawn never wedges the guide. Signature drops
# (each rare's sole drop) ride as optional collects; the rest get
# kill-notes, with pointers where the rare feeds a quest line (some
# rares drop Troll Tribal Necklaces for Horde-core 7842, OOX beacons
# for main-guide 485, and Wildvine recipe stock the recipes companion
# owns - no core quest takes any of these rares as giver, ender, or
# kill objective). Six of the ten sit above the 38-46 Horde band and
# carry come-back-later notes. The Jintha'Alor named spawns (Hexx,
# the Aman'zasi court, Hitah'ya) are core quest targets or unflagged
# regulars - ruled out in the inventory, never shipped here. No tame
# lines: tameability has no data flag and the core guide carries no
# tame corroboration (logged in docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Respawn timers are unconfirmed everywhere. There are no item-start
# hunts to route (the Horde contract has no item-started quests).
# No accept/turnin lines anywhere. See
# docs/hinterlands-horde-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory.
guide butler-routes-completionist/hinterlands-horde-rares
title Hinterlands (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 38-46
zone The Hinterlands
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords hinterlands, horde, rares, treasures, collectibles, companions
coords live
version 1

step Razorfen downs - Razortalon

  zone map 1425

  goto 37.06,45.33
  kill 8210 optional
  collect 283545 "Moonchaser's Headdress" optional
  note Razortalon (level 44) works the downs. The Headdress is his sole drop anywhere in the data. He also drops an OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon, the starter of main-guide 485 - noted, never accepted here.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step West den - Old Cliff Jumper

  zone map 1425

  loop
  goto 11.92,53.7
  goto 96.9,14.6
  kill 8211 optional
  note Old Cliff Jumper (level 42) runs the west den and across into Hillsbrad - both data points ride one loop. No signature loot, no core quest takes him.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step East creek - The Reak

  zone map 1425

