  note Mith'rethis the Enchanter (level 52, Rare Elite) sits above the 38-46 band - come back later. The Robes are his sole drop anywhere in the data. He drops Troll Tribal Necklaces for Horde-core 7842, an OOX beacon for main-guide 485, and the Wildvine recipe stock the recipes companion routes - pointers only, never accepted here. The Jintha'Alor court below (Hexx and her guards) are core quest targets, not rares - not shipped.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

